msgstr "Notes SEO:"

msgid "The base slug is used to build URLs like /boats/{boat-slug}/ (or /barcos/... depending on language)."
msgstr "El slug base s'utilitza per construir URL com /boats/{boat-slug}/ (o /barcos/... segons l'idioma)."

msgid "The simple multi-language format is intentionally straightforward: \"es:barcos,en:boats\"."
msgstr "El format multilingüe simple és intencionadament senzill: \"es:barcos,en:boats\"."

